  "desc": "Spoken-alphabet phonemes rearranged into cut-up sound-poetry: letters are dealt out of the dirt-samples alphabet folder in shifting <> stanzas, speed-bent and answered by a reversed echo voice, then walked by iter() with phrase-end reversals. Long delay throws and a slow filter/pan tide turn scattered consonants and vowels into a spacious, Dada-ish recitation.",
